{"id":"bd0a5970265c8091","group":"29","path":"29/29-df-graph-canonization.md","title":"标号彩色图的规范化映射","display":"df-graph-canonization — 标号彩色图的规范化映射","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-df-graph-canonization","aliases":["29-df-graph-canonization"],"display":"df-graph-canonization — 标号彩色图的规范化映射","depends_on":["[[29-df-colored-graph]]","[[29-df-isomorphism]]","[[29-df-bin-encoding]]"],"source_locator":"§12.1 following Eq.(12.5), p.183, DjVu scan 198","source_basis":"用户提供的 DjVu 正文；独立抽取及来源核对见本轮维护报告"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-df-graph-canonization"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-df-graph-canonization</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-graph-canonization — 标号彩色图的规范化映射"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"dd6d5729a326908a\" href=\"?note=dd6d5729a326908a\" title=\"29-df-colored-graph\">29-df-colored-graph</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3a603dc4f41b07de\" href=\"?note=3a603dc4f41b07de\" title=\"29-df-isomorphism\">29-df-isomorphism</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"57d3a90cf94ef42e\" href=\"?note=57d3a90cf94ef42e\" title=\"29-df-bin-encoding\">29-df-bin-encoding</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"§12.1 following Eq.(12.5), p.183, DjVu scan 198"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"用户提供的 DjVu 正文；独立抽取及来源核对见本轮维护报告"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\geq0\">\\(r\\geq0\\)</span>；下式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal G_r\">\\(\\mathcal G_r\\)</span> 只包含论域为某个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[n]=\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\}\">\\([n]=\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\}\\)</span> 的非空有限彩色图，因而为集合。对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\in\\mathcal G_r\">\\(G\\in\\mathcal G_r\\)</span> 记 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n_G=\\operatorname{card}(|G|)\">\\(n_G=\\operatorname{card}(|G|)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\cong\">\\(\\cong\\)</span> 保持边和所有颜色谓词；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bin}_{\\tau_r}((G,&lt;))\">\\(\\operatorname{bin}_{\\tau_r}((G,&lt;))\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"57d3a90cf94ef42e\" href=\"?note=57d3a90cf94ef42e\" title=\"29-df-bin-encoding\">29-df-bin-encoding</a> 的固定编码。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;_{n}\">\\(&lt;_{n}\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[n]\">\\([n]\\)</span> 上标准严格序；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{lex}\">\\(\\operatorname{lex}\\)</span> 为等长二进制串的字典序。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\\subseteq\\mathcal G_r\">\\(\\mathcal C\\subseteq\\mathcal G_r\\)</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal G_r\">\\(\\mathcal G_r\\)</span> 内同构封闭；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal C\">\\(f:\\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal C\\)</span>。下式同时定义规范化的性质及一个不附带资源上界的具体映射。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal G_r\\coloneqq\\{G\\in\\mathrm{CGraph}_r\\mid\\exists n\\geq1\\;|G|=[n]\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal G_r\\coloneqq\\{G\\in\\mathrm{CGraph}_r\\mid\\exists n\\geq1\\;|G|=[n]\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Canon}_{\\mathcal C}(f)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\left(\\forall G\\in\\mathcal C\\;f(G)\\cong G\\right)\\land\\left(\\forall G,H\\in\\mathcal C\\;(G\\cong H\\to f(G)=f(H))\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Canon}_{\\mathcal C}(f)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\left(\\forall G\\in\\mathcal C\\;f(G)\\cong G\\right)\\land\\left(\\forall G,H\\in\\mathcal C\\;(G\\cong H\\to f(G)=f(H))\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{can}_r(G)\\coloneqq\\iota H\\in\\mathcal G_r\\left(H\\cong G\\land\\operatorname{bin}_{\\tau_r}((H,&lt;_{n_G}))=\\min_{\\operatorname{lex}}\\{\\operatorname{bin}_{\\tau_r}((K,&lt;_{n_G}))\\mid K\\in\\mathcal G_r,\\ K\\cong G\\}\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{can}_r(G)\\coloneqq\\iota H\\in\\mathcal G_r\\left(H\\cong G\\land\\operatorname{bin}_{\\tau_r}((H,&lt;_{n_G}))=\\min_{\\operatorname{lex}}\\{\\operatorname{bin}_{\\tau_r}((K,&lt;_{n_G}))\\mid K\\in\\mathcal G_r,\\ K\\cong G\\}\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Canon}_{\\mathcal G_r}(\\operatorname{can}_r).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Canon}_{\\mathcal G_r}(\\operatorname{can}_r).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 §12.1，式 (12.5) 后，印刷页 183，扫描页 198。原书要求输出与输入同构，并且同构输入输出同一个代表。本条在标准标号图集合上用字典序最小编码给出存在性构造：固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 时只有有限多个重标号，编码对同域同词汇图单射，因此 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota\">\\(\\iota\\)</span> 的存在唯一性成立。该构造是对原书性质的本地实现，不声称可在多项式时间计算；尤其不把规范化的存在误当作已解决高效图规范化问题。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-colored-graph","status":"resolved","id":"dd6d5729a326908a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-colored-graph]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-isomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"3a603dc4f41b07de","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-isomorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-bin-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"57d3a90cf94ef42e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-bin-encoding]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-bin-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"57d3a90cf94ef42e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\cong$ 保持边和所有颜色谓词；$\\operatorname{bin}_{\\tau_r}((G,<))$ 取 [[29-df-bin-encoding]] 的固定编码。$<_{n}$ 为 $[n]$ 上标准严格序；$\\operatorname{lex}$ 为等长二进制串的字典序。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"r\\geq0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal G_r","display":false},{"tex":"[n]=\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"G\\in\\mathcal G_r","display":false},{"tex":"n_G=\\operatorname{card}(|G|)","display":false},{"tex":"\\cong","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{bin}_{\\tau_r}((G,<))","display":false},{"tex":"<_{n}","display":false},{"tex":"[n]","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{lex}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C\\subseteq\\mathcal G_r","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal G_r","display":false},{"tex":"f:\\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal G_r\\coloneqq\\{G\\in\\mathrm{CGraph}_r\\mid\\exists n\\geq1\\;|G|=[n]\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Canon}_{\\mathcal C}(f)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\left(\\forall G\\in\\mathcal C\\;f(G)\\cong G\\right)\\land\\left(\\forall G,H\\in\\mathcal C\\;(G\\cong H\\to f(G)=f(H))\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{can}_r(G)\\coloneqq\\iota H\\in\\mathcal G_r\\left(H\\cong G\\land\\operatorname{bin}_{\\tau_r}((H,<_{n_G}))=\\min_{\\operatorname{lex}}\\{\\operatorname{bin}_{\\tau_r}((K,<_{n_G}))\\mid K\\in\\mathcal G_r,\\ K\\cong G\\}\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Canon}_{\\mathcal G_r}(\\operatorname{can}_r).","display":true},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota","display":false}],"bytes":2294,"backlinks":[{"id":"38909ffa6d1e85ce","anchor":"ref-108","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[29-df-colored-graph]]、[[29-df-color-class-size]]、[[29-df-graph-canonization]] — 彩色图、色类上界与规范化"},{"id":"ecc0dd131d213345","anchor":"ref-81","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-df-graph-canonization]]"}],"outgoing":["dd6d5729a326908a","3a603dc4f41b07de","57d3a90cf94ef42e"]}